+
+Integration: S → B and C on separate worktrees → C accepted → D → E. Primary owns independent acceptance.
+SQL migration safety, simultaneous publication, full paid-sale fault injection, privacy erasure and browser latency
+remain distinct checks; offline metadata success does not establish any of them.
